# Hush Frontend Configuration
# Optional: Base URL for backend API (leave empty for same-origin / reverse-proxy deployments).
# In local development, defaults to http://localhost:8000 when unset.
# Example for deployed Render backend:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://hush-backend.onrender.com
# Optional: Request timeout in milliseconds (must exceed backend OPENAI_TIMEOUT_SECONDS, defaults to 75000).
# VITE_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS=75000
